OL,3,AMatthew Rhys takes Best Actor at Bafta
OL,4,ACymru for performance in Netflix
OL,5,Athriller
OL,6,
OL,7,FMatthew Rhys has continued his fine
OL,8,Fform this awards season after being
OL,9,Fannounced as the Best Actor at the
OL,10,FBafta Cymru Awards ceremony.
OL,12,FThe actor made history last month when
OL,13,Fhe became the first person to win two
OL,14,Flead acting prizes in one night at the
OL,15,FEmmy's.
OL,17,FPresenter Carol Vorderman said she was
OL,18,F"humbled and excited" to receive an
OL,19,Faward for outstanding contribution,
OL,20,Fwhile Lauren Evans took home an award
OL,21,Ffor her contribution to the film I
OL,22,FSwear.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
