OL,3,AMatthew Rhys takes Best Actor at Bafta
OL,4,ACymru for performance in Netflix
OL,5,Athriller
OL,6,
OL,7,FLee Walters, Bafta Cymru chair,
OL,8,Fcongratulated the nominees last month,
OL,9,Fand said "each is a testament to the
OL,10,Fcreativity, skill and dedication of the
OL,11,Fpeople working across Wales' screen
OL,12,Findustries, both in front of and behind
OL,13,Fthe camera".
